#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/console_keyboards.rst:2
msgid "Hypervisor Console Keyboards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/console_keyboards.rst:4
msgid ""
"HVM VMs support guest console access as well as hypervisor console "
"access. For each HVM VM, users can set a keyboard layout configuration "
"which will then be set for use on each session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/console_keyboards.rst:6
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/console_keyboards.rst:6
msgid ""
"This feature requires |host| agent version 3.0.3 or greater. Upgrade the "
"host agent from the host detail page for **each** host by expanding the "
"ACTIONS menu and clicking \"Upgrade Agent.\" Alternatively, select "
"\"Download Agent Script\" to download a script to run against the host "
"manually from a terminal session. These scripts are specific to each host"
" so you must download a script for each host and run the correct script "
"against the correct host."
msgstr ""

